title: "Infinity Neural Memory"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-23
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, honest, testable memory nervous system for long-running agents:
  append-only event-sourced timeline, hybrid BM25/vector recall with RRF, explainable
  governance gates (admission + pre-action), secret redaction, and Vietnamese NLP.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - event-sourcing
  - retrieval
  - rrf
  - vietnamese-nlp
authors:
  - name: "Infinity Neural Memory contributors"
